sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Quản trị
    participant API as API upload
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant M as MinIO private
    participant W as Worker
    participant E as Image encoder
    participant Q as Qdrant
    Admin->>API: File, metadata, Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Auth, byte/pixel/frame validation, SHA-256
    API->>PG: Reserve UUID và job awaiting_input, dedup
    alt Identity đã available
        PG-->>API: Existing image ID
        API-->>Admin: 200 duplicate, không ghi đè metadata
    else Identity mới
        API->>M: PUT staging theo item UUID
        M-->>API: Durable receipt
        API->>PG: Commit source ref và queued
        API-->>Admin: 202 image ID, job ID
        W->>PG: Claim item SKIP LOCKED, lease, claim token
        PG-->>W: Item và pinned index manifest
        W->>M: GET staging, verify digest
        W->>W: Decode/preprocess, metadata extraction
        W->>E: Encode ảnh theo manifest
        E-->>W: Normalized finite vector
        W->>M: PUT immutable original và optional preview
        M-->>W: Verified receipts
        W->>PG: Persist object/metadata progress với claim CAS
        W->>Q: Upsert UUID point, wait applied
        Q-->>W: Applied acknowledgement
        W->>PG: Verify current claim, commit embedding ready
        Note over W,PG: Lỗi transient retry hữu hạn<br/>Stale claim không publish ready
    end
